    "headerText": "OR3 Plugin + Hook System — Security Audit Pack\n\nScope: ONLY the installable plugin runtime, extension install pipeline (ZIP/URL), access gating, hook engine (client/server/shared), extension registries used by plugins, related docs, and tests.\n\nPrimary security surfaces for review:\n1. server/admin/extensions/* — ZIP/URL install, path traversal, SSRF controls\n2. server/api/plugins/* — runtime manifest + plugin route dispatcher\n3. shared/plugins/access-policy.ts + require-plugin-access — authz gates\n4. app/plugins/workspace-plugins.client.ts — client dynamic load via import.meta.glob\n5. app/core/hooks/* + shared/hooks/* + server/hooks/* — action/filter engine (privilege/intercept surface)\n6. Extension registries (dashboard/sidebar/tools/pane API) — what installed plugins can register\n\nIntentionally excluded: Nuxt infrastructure plugins (theme, workspace-db, sync, auth session), HTTP webhooks feature, chat feature plugins (workflows/mentions), Convex, and the rest of the application.\n\nNote: Duplicate agent-skill reference copies of public docs were omitted; canonical docs live under public/_documentation and docs/."
  },
